// Liberation Sans Bold (SIL Open Font License 1.1), subset to Latin glyphs
// (incl. Yoruba/Igbo diacritics and the naira sign) — about 54 KB.
//
// Why this is embedded instead of loaded from disk or downloaded: Vercel's
// serverless functions run on a minimal Linux image with NO system fonts,
// so canvas text drawn with a generic family like "sans-serif" silently
// renders nothing there (it works on a GitHub Codespace only because that
// machine happens to have fonts installed). Embedding the font in the code
// means it is always present in the deployed function — no file-tracing
// config, no network call on cold start.
export const WATERMARK_FONT_BASE64 =
  "";
